11
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:18,640
But the only person I feel I owe is you.

12
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,760
to your credit

13
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,560
At least he should be a general

14
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,560
I feel wronged to you

15
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,600
General, General Mo doesn't care about this.

16
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,360
