17
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,120
Don’t you want to get promoted and make a fortune?

18
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:30,080
General, this is not what General Mo wants.

19
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:32,640
General, General Mo wants to ask someone who

20
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,560
Guan Peide

21
