29
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:51,670
Later it became the Huangqing national weapon

30
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,710
I was able to guard Yanmen Pass back then

31
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:54,670
He also helped

32
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:55,670
A gift of support

33
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:56,670
what kind of person is he

34
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:57,790
Full-time youth company

35
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:58,990
No greed, no war

36
00:00:58,990 --> 00:01:00,150
is famous for please scrape

37
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:01,670
