49
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:27,310
Guan Peide is dead, dead

50
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:28,310
ten years ago

51
00:01:28,310 --> 00:01:29,510
Died at home

52
00:01:29,510 --> 00:01:30,510
It's a good thing
